docs {
  ## List Applied Jobs — Unauthorized (No Auth)

  Expects a 401 response when no Authorization header is provided.

  ### Expected Response (401)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "error": "Missing or invalid Authorization header"
  }
  ```
}
